  "description": "Joo-Ho, who became human from an abandoned zoo tiger; Hee-Heon, who possesses a mystical power that turned Joo-Ho into a human; the two who spent their childhood together like brothers are separated due to Hee-Heon's mistake. Then one day, 10 years later, Joo-Ho receives an urgent call from Hee-Heon.\n\n *\"We need to meet right now. The spell is wearing off.\"*\n\nThe two meet again. There, Joo-Ho hears a rather shocking method to reinforce the spell.\n\n *\"You have to... do it with me for 100 days.\"*\n\nWill Joo-Ho be able to survive the 100 days like this and become a whole person?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
